  "project": "PRJDB39888",
  "project_title": "RNA-Seq Profiling of iPS, iPS-PDL, and PDL Cells",
  "project_description": "The study goal of this project is to analyze and compare the gene expression profiles of iPS cells, primary periodontal ligament (PDL) cells, and iPS-PDL cells using RNA-seq. Three independent samples from each cell type were examined. This dataset provides transcriptomic information relevant to understanding iPS-to-PDL differentiation and supports research on periodontal tissue regeneration.",
